nconsistent with other actions like dragging items on top of inspector sections (which uses a delay configured in some project/editor setting). The delay avoids accidentally switching tabs when quickly dragging an item on top of unrelated tabs.\r\n\r\nSee KDE's Dolphin for comparison:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d901b646-1a23-44a7-8bb2-cb98710b0038\r\n\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103478#pullrequestreview-2658395169","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103478","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-04T17:20:44Z"},{"id":2829288198,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6oo4MG","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"It might be good to get #103601 in first for the drag and drop tests.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103478#pullrequestreview-2829288198","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103478","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-15T18:19:17Z"},{"id":2844810669,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pkF2t","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103478#pullrequestreview-2844810669","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103478","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-15T20:16:45Z"},{"id":2846377016,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pqEQ4","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103478#pullrequestreview-2846377016","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103478","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-16T11:40:52Z"},{"id":2847033546,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pskjK","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev"},"body":"This causes errors when dragging a node from the scene dock, switching to another scene by hovering over the scene tab bar, and trying to drop to the scene dock. It seems to sometimes crash, not sure how exactly to reproduce yet.\r\nSo the scene tree dock dragging logic will need some tweaks.\r\n\r\n`  ERROR: Node not found: \"/root/@EditorNode@21408/@Panel@14/@VBoxContainer@15/DockHSplitLeftL/DockHSplitLeftR/DockHSplitMain/@VBoxContainer@26/DockVSplitCenter/@VSplitContainer@54/@VBoxContainer@55/@EditorMainScreen@102/MainScreen/@CanvasItemEditor@11646/@VSplitContainer@11298/@HSplitContainer@11300/@HSplitContainer@11302/@Control@11303/@SubViewportContainer@11304/@SubViewport@11305/Control2/Control\" (absolute path attempted from \"/root/@EditorNode@21408/@Panel@14/@VBoxContainer@15/DockHSplitLeftL/DockHSplitLeftR/DockVSplitLeftR/DockSlotLeftUR/Scene/@SceneTreeEditor@5127\").`\r\n\r\nThere is also issues when trying to drag text between text edits in a similar way, when dragging between scenes changes the inspector and creates TextEdits. I guess this is because it never receives `NOTIFICATION_DRAG_BEGIN` since the dragging started before it existed.\r\n`  ERROR: The main caret should not be removed.\r\n  ERROR: scene\\gui\\tree.cpp:1509 - Index p_column = 0 is out of bounds (cells.size() = 0).`\r\nThis seems like a larger dragging issue, and NOTIFICATION_DRAG_BEGIN should be sent to all new nodes while dragging is ongoing.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103478#pullrequestreview-2847033546","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103478","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-16T16:46:45Z"},{"id":2847255760,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ptazQ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","login":"kitbdev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.gith